  "content": {
    "id": "p13-q14-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "14",
    "prompt": "Given that $y\\propto x^2$, what is the effect on $y$ when $x$ is:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p13-q14-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "doubled",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y$ is multiplied by $4$.",
          "worked": "Since $y=kx^2$, choose $x=1$, giving $y=k$. After doubling $x$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=k(2)^2\\\\y&=4k\\end{align*}$$\nThus $y$ is multiplied by $4$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 26
      },
      {
        "id": "p13-q14-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "multiplied by $4$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y$ is multiplied by $16$.",
          "worked": "Since $y=kx^2$, choose $x=1$, giving $y=k$. After multiplying $x$ by $4$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=k(4)^2\\\\y&=16k\\end{align*}$$\nThus $y$ is multiplied by $16$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 26
      },
      {
        "id": "p13-q14-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "divided by $5$?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y$ is divided by $25$.",
          "worked": "Since $y=kx^2$, choose $x=1$, giving $y=k$. After dividing $x$ by $5$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=k\\left(\\frac15\\right)^2\\\\y&=\\frac{k}{25}\\end{align*}$$\nThus $y$ is divided by $25$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      }
    ]
